  "title": "Utillian 5 V4 Wax Pen Vaporizer (taxes extra)",
  "description": "UTILLIAN 5 V4\n\nThe Utillian 5 is a powerful Wax Pen designed to be a portable powerhouse. Its redesign now includes a USB-C charging port, which makes it even more of an absolute workhorse.\n\nThis Wax Pen includes two heating elements and a black ceramic mouthpiece design with an integrated loading tool, and splash guard.\n\nKey Features:\nUSB-C Port\nRevamped Heating Chamber\nTough PVD Coating\n4 Voltage Settings\nAdjustable Airflow\n\nIncluded in the Box:\nUtillian 5 V4 Wax Pen Kit\nTwisted Kanthal Coil\nTriple Titanium Coil\nUSB-C Cable\n3 Mouthpiece Seals\n6 Atomizer Cap O-Rings\n\nOptional Bubbler:\nTake your Utillian 5 sessions to the next level with the Utillian 5 Water Bubbler. The bubbler adds water filtration to the Utillian 5, allowing you to maximize your draws while cooling down your vapor. Just mount the bubbler on top of the Utillian 5 mouthpiece to enjoy a smooth session. A must have accessory for the Utillian 5 wax pen.",
  "description_html": "<p><strong>UTILLIAN 5 V4<br />  <br /></strong>The Utillian 5 is a powerful Wax Pen designed to be a portable powerhouse. Its redesign now includes a USB-C charging port, which makes it even more of an absolute workhorse. </p>\n<p>This Wax Pen includes two heating elements and a black ceramic mouthpiece design with an integrated loading tool, and splash guard.</p>\n<p><strong>Key Features:</strong><br />    USB-C Port<br />    Revamped Heating Chamber<br />    Tough PVD Coating<br />    4 Voltage Settings<br />    Adjustable Airflow</p>\n<p><strong>Included in the Box:</strong><br />    Utillian 5 V4 Wax Pen Kit<br />    Twisted Kanthal Coil<br />    Triple Titanium Coil<br />    USB-C Cable<br />    3 Mouthpiece Seals<br />    6 Atomizer Cap O-Rings</p>\n<p><strong>Optional Bubbler:</strong><br />Take your Utillian 5 sessions to the next level with the Utillian 5 Water Bubbler. The bubbler adds water filtration to the Utillian 5, allowing you to maximize your draws while cooling down your vapor. Just mount the bubbler on top of the Utillian 5 mouthpiece to enjoy a smooth session. A must have accessory for the Utillian 5 wax pen.<strong></strong></p>",
